WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
I think Christine Ohm should have consequences.

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.840
I think she should be tried at the Hague.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.600
What we are seeing from her operation

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.280
are crimes against humanity.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.840
Agents have $10,000 death warrants

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.560
and are getting doxed with tracking apps.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.760
In Portland, an American city doesn't care.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.000
ICE agents can't even pull in and out of their office.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.000
ICE agents have been hit with sticks,

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.480
shot with fireworks, roasted by lasers,

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.240
and pelted with paint balls.

